      "filename": "Bovey Tracey, Haytor Tramway in Yarner Woods - geograph.org.uk - 42156.jpg",
      "title": "File:Bovey Tracey, Haytor Tramway in Yarner Woods - geograph.org.uk - 42156.jpg",
